\f0\fs28\b Closebook \endash  Rental Conversion Uploader\b0\fs22\par
\b Google Ads API \endash  Design Document\b0\par
\par
\b 1. Overview\b0\par
Closebook is an internal back-office application used by Avon Rents / Hollywood Depot Rentals (HDR) employees. This tool uploads offline conversions (completed equipment-rental bookings) from our internal CRM to Google Ads, so that ad bidding can optimize toward booked-rental revenue rather than only website form fills. It is used solely to manage our own Google Ads accounts; it is not offered to third parties or the public.\par
\par
\b 2. Who uses it\b0\par
Internal employees only. There is no public or client-facing interface. The tool runs server-side as a scheduled job; staff interact only with the internal CRM.\par
\par
\b 3. Google Ads API services used\b0\par
\bullet  ConversionUploadService.UploadClickConversions \endash  to upload offline lead conversions enhanced with hashed user-provided data (Enhanced Conversions for Leads).\par
No other services are called. The tool does not read campaign data, does not create or manage accounts, campaigns, ad groups, ads, or budgets.\par
\par
\b 4. Data flow\b0\par
(1) A rental inquiry is captured in the CRM from the website. (2) When a sales rep marks the inquiry as a booked rental (status "Confirmed" or "Out"), the CRM queues a conversion with the booking value. (3) A scheduled daily job reads queued bookings and calls UploadClickConversions, sending: the conversion action resource name, conversion date-time, conversion value (USD), an order ID for de-duplication, and SHA-256 hashed customer email and phone number as user identifiers. (4) Google Ads matches the conversion to the originating ad click via the hashed identifiers.\par
\par
\b 5. Authentication\b0\par
OAuth 2.0 with a refresh token for an internal employee account. Requests are made with our developer token and a manager (MCC) login-customer-id. Customer data terms have been accepted and Enhanced Conversions for Leads is enabled on the account.\par
\par
\b 6. Volume\b0\par
Low. Approximately a few conversion uploads per day (one per booked rental). No bulk or high-frequency operations.\par
\par
\b 7. Campaign types supported\b0\par
Search, Performance Max.\par
\par
\b 8. Capabilities provided\b0\par
Conversion tracking / offline conversion upload (reporting of business outcomes back to Google Ads). The tool does not provide account creation or account management.\par
